The US Colonies were:

1. New England (New Hampshire; Massachusetts; Rhode Island; Connecticut);
2. Middle (New York; New Jersey; Pennsylvania; Delaware);
3. Southern (Maryland; Virginia; North Carolina; South Carolina; and Georgia).

So, there were three states that made up the US Colonies: New England, Middle, and Southern.

